  "releaseNotes": "The Symphony Core Connector WinForms Extensions.\n\nSymphony Core is a high-performance enterprise platform that unifies business data, workflows, and integrations in one reliable backend foundation.\n\nSymphony Core is the backend platform of Symphony. It is accessed from client applications through the connector API.\n\nThis package provides Windows Forms-specific controls and drawing helpers for visualizing connector-related data such as query structures, preloads, and workflow structures.\n\nUse Connector (base package) in all cases, because these controls depend on it. Add Connector.Extensions when you also need non-UI helper and convenience APIs beyond the base connector functionality.",
